Spec: Windows retained connection verification

Purpose:
  Verify original operation outcomes and current state remain distinct across restart and failed attachment.

Owns:
  ./ConnectionJournalTests.cs

Must:
  Exercise exact local access, policy narrowing, one-use attachments, replay/conflict, close intent, stale snapshots and bounded crash recovery on real SQLite.
  Verify actual lifecycle meter FIN/drain, uint64 overflow and monotonic clock failure with deterministic clocks.
  Cover schema-seven migration without invented connections and preserve prior access/operation results.
